## Type-specific requirements (spec type: {{ spec_type }})

{% if spec_type == 'button' %}
**Button** — label-only API, never `children`.

CSS must include ALL of the following CSS rules:
- `.pandora-{{ component_name_lower }}` — base: padding, background `var(--primary)`, color `var(--on-primary)`, border-radius, font-weight 600, cursor pointer, border none, `transition: background 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease`.
- `.pandora-{{ component_name_lower }}:hover` — lighter/brighter treatment: `filter: brightness(1.08)` or lighter background token.
- `.pandora-{{ component_name_lower }}:active` — pressed: `transform: translateY(1px); box-shadow: none`.
- `.pandora-{{ component_name_lower }}:focus-visible` — `outline: 2px solid var(--primary); outline-offset: 2px`.
- `.pandora-{{ component_name_lower }}:disabled` — `opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; pointer-events: none`.
- One rule per variant class: `--primary` (solid fill), `--secondary` (muted bg), `--outline` (border, transparent bg, primary text), `--ghost` (transparent, no border, primary text). Each MUST differ in background, color, and border.

{% elif spec_type == 'card' %}
**Card** — `<article>` root with header + optional body children.

CSS must include:
- Base card: `background: var(--surface); border-radius: var(--radius, 8px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm, 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.10)); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(0,0,0,0.08)); overflow: hidden`.
- Header: `padding: <spacing>; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(0,0,0,0.08))`.
- Body: adequate padding, `color: var(--text-muted)`, readable `line-height: 1.55`.
- If variants exist: e.g. `--elevated` uses a stronger shadow; `--flat` removes shadow and uses only border; `--featured` uses `var(--primary)` as header background.
- Hover (if interactive): `box-shadow: var(--shadow-md, 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)); transform: translateY(-1px); transition: all 0.15s ease`.

{% elif spec_type == 'badge' %}
**Badge** — `<span>` inline pill.

CSS must include:
- Base: `display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 0.2em 0.65em; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap`.
- Variant rules: `--default` (surface bg, muted text border), `--primary` (var(--primary) bg, var(--on-primary) text), `--success` (green tones), `--warning` (amber), `--danger` (red). Each must use a different bg/text pair.

{% elif spec_type == 'navigation' %}
**Navigation** — `<nav>` with `<ul>`/`<li>` list.

CSS must include:
- Nav wrapper: appropriate flex or horizontal layout, gap, background if needed.
- Link base: `color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; padding: 0.4em 0.75em; border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 4px); transition: color 0.15s, background 0.15s`.
- Link hover: `color: var(--primary); background: rgba(var(--primary), 0.06)` or a light primary tint.
- Link active (`.is-active`): `color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; background: …`.
- If variant `vertical`: stack items with left border active indicator.

{% elif spec_type == 'input' %}
**Input field** — `<label htmlFor>` + `<input id>`.

CSS must include:
- Wrapper: `display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: <spacing>`.
- Label: `font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.03em; color: var(--text, #0f172a)`.
- Input: `padding: 0.55em 0.85em; border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #cbd5e1); border-radius: var(--radius, 6px); font-size: 0.95rem; background: var(--surface); color: var(--text); transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box`.
- Input focus: `border-color: var(--primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(var(--primary-rgb, 37 99 235) / 0.15); outline: none`.
- Error state: `border-color: var(--error, #dc2626)`.
- Error message: `font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--error, #dc2626)`.

{% elif spec_type == 'modal' %}
**Modal** — overlay + centered dialog panel.

CSS must include:
- Overlay: `position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.45); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 50; backdrop-filter: blur(2px)`.
- Panel: `background: var(--surface); border-radius: calc(var(--radius, 8px) * 1.5); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.22); max-width: 32rem; width: 90%; padding: 1.75rem; position: relative`.
- Title: `font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem`.
- When `open` is false, render null or return null.

{% elif spec_type == 'hero' %}
**Hero section** — large page-top section.

CSS must include:
- Section: `padding: 5rem 2rem; text-align: center; background: var(--surface)`.
- Headline: `font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--text)`.
- Subtitle: `font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 38rem; margin: 1rem auto 0`.
- CTA area: flex row, gap, centered.

{% elif spec_type == 'layout' %}
**Layout / Section** — semantic content container.

CSS must include:
- Section container: `padding: 4rem 2rem; max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto`.
- Section heading: `font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.5rem`.
- Optional subtitle: `color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55`.

